@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}
<main aria-labelledby="title" class="my-4">
    <h2 id="title" class="fw-bold text-primary">About PrimeTech Catalog</h2>
    <p class="lead">ASP.NET MVC Web Application Practical Assignment</p>

    <div class="card p-4 mt-3 shadow-sm border">
        <p>This application demonstrates ASP.NET MVC architecture featuring:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Strongly-typed Model binding with <code>Product</code> entities</li>
            <li>Controller actions implementing <code>Index</code> and <code>Details</code> routes</li>
            <li>Razor Views rendering responsive Bootstrap UI components</li>
            <li>Dynamic catalog data manipulation using LINQ queries</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Developed by Rajvirsinh Dodiya at Marwadi University as part of .NET Technology Laboratory Work.</p>
    </div>
</main>